sprites-hard 2026-11-25: despair.png: no web copy of the creature exists (source unknown). Re-cut from the video's own frame https://i.ytimg.com/vi/U67wZoy-1fE/maxres1.jpg (square at x316-515,y261-460, 200px): 3x Lanczos, alpha unmixed against the measured square colour (172,127,97) so the black silhouette keeps its own edge (no fading); white eyes kept opaque. 512px ~92% bottom-flush. Horizontal spike tips and tendril base touch the square edge in the video too.
